<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets 65 mln call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>BZW sets 65 mln call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 65 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$177.975     PREMIUM	 14.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.585	 GEARING	 10.69X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.NOV.97	PAYDATE	 03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$169.50	LISTING DATE  05.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
